b>and <\\/b><b>wastes<\\/b> <b>build up in <\\/b><b>the<\\/b> <b>body.<\\/b><b> In <\\/b><b>the<\\/b> <b>case<\\/b> <b>of chronic<\\/b> <b>renal<\\/b> <b>failure,<\\/b> <b>the <\\/b><b>\\u00a0kidneys<\\/b> <b>do<\\/b> <b>not<\\/b> <b>improve<\\/b> <b>and<\\/b> <b>people<\\/b> <b>need<\\/b> <b>dialysis<\\/b> <b>for<\\/b> <b>the<\\/b> <b>rest<\\/b> <b>of<\\/b> <b>their<\\/b> <b>lives, <\\/b><b>\\u00a0<\\/b><b>until<\\/b> <b>they<\\/b> <b>get<\\/b> <b>a<\\/b> <b>kidney<\\/b> <b>transplant.<\\/b><\\/p><p>Due to growing cases of CKD, the patients undergoing dialysis are also increasing \\u00a0by 10-15 percent every year. India is estimated to have about <b>130,000<\\/b> <b>patients<\\/b> <b>on <\\/b><b>\\u00a0<\\/b><b>Hemodialysis<\\/b> <b>and<\\/b> <b>over<\\/b> <b>3400<\\/b> <b>patients<\\/b> <b>in<\\/b> <b>each<\\/b> <b>state.<\\/b> The approximate \\u00a0prevalence of CKD is <b>800 <\\/b><b>people<\\/b> <b>per<\\/b> <b>million<\\/b> <b>population.<\\/b><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"57a5a38\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Why\\ta\\tDialysis\\tCentre? \\n\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#303030\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Roboto\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"d52ac16\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><b>Over<\\/b><b> 90% <\\/b><b>of <\\/b><b>patients<\\/b> <b>requiring<\\/b> <b>Dialysis<\\/b> <b>in India<\\/b> <b>die<\\/b> <b>because<\\/b> <b>of <\\/b><b>\\u00a0<\\/b><b>inability <\\/b><b>to<\\/b><b> afford <\\/b><b>care,<\\/b><b> and <\\/b><b>even<\\/b><b> in <\\/b><b>those<\\/b> <b>who do start dialysis, <\\/b><b>\\u00a060% <\\/b><b>stop<\\/b> <b>for<\\/b> <b>financial<\\/b> <b>reasons,<\\/b> <b>for<\\/b> <b>it costs<\\/b> <b>more<\\/b> <b>than<\\/b> <b>Rs<\\/b> <b>13,000 <\\/b><b>\\u00a0<\\/b><b>for <\\/b><b>4 <\\/b><b>shifts<\\/b> <b>for<\\/b> <b>a<\\/b> <b>pa