r a long dialysis session. Hence a suitable site, that is comfortably accessible for the locals, must be chosen.<\\/strong><\\/li><li><strong><i>Ease <\\/i><i>in<\\/i> <i>commute<\\/i> <i>with<\\/i> <i>public<\\/i> <i>transport,<\\/i> <i>like<\\/i> <i>autos, buses,<\\/i> <i>and <\\/i><i>\\u00a0<\\/i><i>trains<\\/i> <i>is<\\/i><i> a <\\/i><i>must within <\\/i><i>a <\\/i><i>radius<\\/i> <i>of <\\/i><i>3-5km <\\/i><i>around the<\\/i> <i>site.<\\/i><\\/strong><\\/li><li><strong><i>Ensure<\\/i> <i>there<\\/i> <i>is<\\/i><i> a<\\/i> <i>hospital<\\/i> <i>close<\\/i> <i>by<\\/i> <i>in <\\/i><i>case<\\/i> <i>of<\\/i> <i>any<\\/i> <i>emergency.<\\/i><\\/strong><\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"5bc7783\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/rotarydialysis.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/04\\/Picture5.png\",\"id\":212,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"acd1ed7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/rotarydialysis.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/04\\/Picture6.png\",\"id\":213,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]');
