INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (220,1,'2023-04-18 00:05:32','2023-04-18 00:05:32','<h2>KINDNESS \nin health \n</h2>		\n			<h3>What is	Dialysis? </h3>		\n		<p>In healthy individuals, The kidneys filter waste and excess fluids from your blood,  which are then excreted in the urine.</p><p>Dialysis is a treatment method that replicates the function of the kidneys when they  are failing.</p><p>Some cases of acute kidney disease, however, can be treated and dialysis may only  be required in the short term.</p><p><b>However, </b><b>in </b><b>cases </b><b>of </b><b>kidney </b><b>failure, </b><b>this </b><b>mechanism </b><b>fails and individuals </b><b>need </b><b> </b><b>to </b><b>undergo </b><b>dialysis. Dialysis can </b><b>be </b><b>used </b><b>to </b><b>treat </b><b>people </b><b>with chronic or </b><b>acute </b><b> </b><b>kidney</b> <b>disease.</b></p>		\n			<h3>Chronic	Kidney	Disease</h3>		\n												<img width=\"750\" height=\"292\" src=\"http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture2-1024x398.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture2-1024x398.jpg 1024w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture2-300x117.jpg 300w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture2-768x299.jpg 768w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture2.jpg 1365w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />														\n			<h3>CKD	in	India\n</h3>		\n		<p>The number of patients affected by <b>Chronic</b> <b>Kidney</b> <b>Disease</b> <b>have</b> <b>doubled</b> <b>in </b><b> </b><b>the </b><b>last </b><b>14 </b><b>years</b><b>. </b>Chronic Kidney Disease (CKD) is one among those, in which  lives are lost due to prohibitive cost of continuous dialysis treatment. CKD  describes the gradual loss of kidney function.</p><p><b>When</b> <b>it </b><b>reaches</b> <b>an </b><b>advanced </b><b>stage,</b> <b>dangerous</b> <b>levels</b> <b>of fluid,</b> <b>electrolytes </b><b> </b><b>and </b><b>wastes</b> <b>build up in </b><b>the</b> <b>body.</b><b> In </b><b>the</b> <b>case</b> <b>of chronic</b> <b>renal</b> <b>failure,</b> <b>the </b><b> kidneys</b> <b>do</b> <b>not</b> <b>improve</b> <b>and</b> <b>people</b> <b>need</b> <b>dialysis</b> <b>for</b> <b>the</b> <b>rest</b> <b>of</b> <b>their</b> <b>lives, </b><b> </b><b>until</b> <b>they</b> <b>get</b> <b>a</b> <b>kidney</b> <b>transplant.</b></p><p>Due to growing cases of CKD, the patients undergoing dialysis are also increasing  by 10-15 percent every year. India is estimated to have about <b>130,000</b> <b>patients</b> <b>on </b><b> </b><b>Hemodialysis</b> <b>and</b> <b>over</b> <b>3400</b> <b>patients</b> <b>in</b> <b>each</b> <b>state.</b> The approximate  prevalence of CKD is <b>800 </b><b>people</b> <b>per</b> <b>million</b> <b>population.</b></p>		\n			<h3>Why	a	Dialysis	Centre? \n</h3>		\n		<p><b>Over</b><b> 90% </b><b>of </b><b>patients</b> <b>requiring</b> <b>Dialysis</b> <b>in India</b> <b>die</b> <b>because</b> <b>of </b><b> </b><b>inability </b><b>to</b><b> afford </b><b>care,</b><b> and </b><b>even</b><b> in </b><b>those</b> <b>who do start dialysis, </b><b> 60% </b><b>stop</b> <b>for</b> <b>financial</b> <b>reasons,</b> <b>for</b> <b>it costs</b> <b>more</b> <b>than</b> <b>Rs</b> <b>13,000 </b><b> </b><b>for </b><b>4 </b><b>shifts</b> <b>for</b> <b>a</b> <b>patient</b><b> in </b><b>a</b> <b>private</b> <b>hospital.</b></p>		\n												<img width=\"750\" height=\"222\" src=\"http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture3-1024x303.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture3-1024x303.jpg 1024w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture3-300x89.jpg 300w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture3-768x228.jpg 768w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture3.jpg 1208w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />														\n			<h3>How	can	we	help?\n</h3>		\n		<p>To find a solution to this issue would require stabilising  and establishing several FREE Dialysis Centres  around the state with the help of:</p><ul><li>Greater Chennai Corporation Charitable Trust Hospital Government</li><li>Peripheral Hospitals  Rotary Hospitals</li></ul>		\n			<h4>We can help by spreading\nkindness	in health.\n</h4>		\n			<h3>Preliminary	Requirements\n</h3>		\n			<h3>For a dialysis	Centre: \n</h3>		\n		<ul><li><strong>Kidney patients always feel mentally tired after a long dialysis session. Hence a suitable site, that is comfortably accessible for the locals, must be chosen.</strong></li><li><strong><i>Ease </i><i>in</i> <i>commute</i> <i>with</i> <i>public</i> <i>transport,</i> <i>like</i> <i>autos, buses,</i> <i>and </i><i> </i><i>trains</i> <i>is</i><i> a </i><i>must within </i><i>a </i><i>radius</i> <i>of </i><i>3-5km </i><i>around the</i> <i>site.</i></strong></li><li><strong><i>Ensure</i> <i>there</i> <i>is</i><i> a</i> <i>hospital</i> <i>close</i> <i>by</i> <i>in </i><i>case</i> <i>of</i> <i>any</i> <i>emergency.</i></strong></li></ul>		\n												<img width=\"750\" height=\"419\" src=\"http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture5-1024x572.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture5-1024x572.png 1024w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture5-300x167.png 300w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture5-768x429.png 768w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture5-1536x857.png 1536w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture5-2048x1143.png 2048w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture5-1568x875.png 1568w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />														\n												<img width=\"750\" height=\"430\" src=\"http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture6-1024x587.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture6-1024x587.png 1024w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture6-300x172.png 300w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture6-768x440.png 768w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture6-1536x880.png 1536w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture6-1568x898.png 1568w, http://rotarydialysis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Picture6.png 1882w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','170-revision-v1','','','2023-04-18 00:05:32','2023-04-18 00:05:32','',170,'http://rotarydialysis.com/?p=220',0,'revision','',0);
